    "name": "Portable Flashing Package: Linux ROM for Y1 Developers / Modders",
    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom&amp;tag=0.0.1#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Y1 \u00b7 Type A**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom&amp;tag=0.0.1&amp;asset=rom.zip&amp;platform=windows&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom&amp;tag=0.0.1&amp;asset=rom.zip&amp;platform=windows-legacy&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows-legacy.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows 7 for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - XP/7/8.1 \u00b7 SP Flash Tool guide\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom&amp;tag=0.0.1&amp;asset=rom.zip&amp;platform=linux&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom&amp;tag=0.0.1&amp;asset=rom.zip&amp;platform=linux-arm64&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux-arm64.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux arm64 for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom&amp;tag=0.0.1&amp;asset=rom.zip&amp;platform=linux-legacy&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux-legacy.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for 32-bit Linux for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - pre-AppImage \u00b7 SP Flash Tool\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom&amp;tag=0.0.1&amp;asset=rom.zip&amp;platform=macos&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fy1-linux-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y1-linux-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\nThis is a release of Linux for the Innioasis Y1 intended for developers to create novel experiences on the Innioasis Y1 audio player.\r\n\r\nCredit to @palutenfan123 for building this.\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"725eb4c8da00f9a00d87b1e13298357b07c518b358b2e51d8c1cd7100bc41c98\",\"size\":492284289,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows-legacy.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows-legacy\",\"sha256\":\"9e30367d9f590e4cfd36a7a3c930a995d7de18bfefd7eda2df8e78e82c858a10\",\"size\":331133872,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"b84d50be45371d11419af3eedd36131ffed75ec100eb399030c93d6ce0285580\",\"size\":616155805,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux-arm64.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux-arm64\",\"sha256\":\"